# The draw order at every bridge, stair and gate the visual QA sweep visited (out/qa6, its
# 93 crossing, stair and gate places): at 1x nobody is drawn against the depth comparator or
# below the floor they stand on; at 1/2 nobody shows inside something in front of them. Slow:
# labelled heavy. Each place's 1x frame lands in shots/crossing_*.
set season spring
set day 9
set time 0.17
set clock day
set weather clear
