set city 95,1215
set city camera
set world 95 1215 1
wait 45
expect city order 0 0
expect city sunk 0 0
shot shots/crossing_bridge_95_1215.png
set world 95 1215 0.5
wait 30
expect city order 0 0
expect city covered 2 0 0
